mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): a bodiless `format`. Nothing loads it.

form record
  link level, like text
  link message, like text
  link timestamp, like size
  link fields
    like hash
      like text
      like unknown
  link error

task format
  take record, like record
  take
    style
    like text
    fall text <text>
  take
    color
    like boolean
    fall false
  like text
